    clothesIntro: 'Clothing in Australia is very similar to the Netherlands: there are <b>loads of great brands</b> and especially lots of sports and swimwear brands. In the big cities you find <b>Westfield malls</b> and big chains like H&M, Zara and Cotton On. For summer and spring bring the essentials, and in winter add a few thick jumpers and a (bomber) jacket.',
    lists: [
      {
        id: 'basis',
        title: 'Basic packing list',
        sub: 'Essential items for every trip',
